    "detailed_description": "\uff081\uff09 Introduction to the game<br />\r\n&quot;Alien Maze&quot; is a puzzle game to explore the maze. Players need to reach the exit in a limited time.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\uff082\uff09 Game play<br />\r\nThe game operation uses the keyboard to operate the movement, and gets the acorn in the maze through the road.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOperation mode<br />\r\nW (upper) S (lower) A (left) D (right)<br />\r\nThe labyrinth road is winding. If you are not careful, you will go wrong. Use your brain and get out of the labyrinth.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game has a built-in one-button unlocking function.You need to press the 2 and 5 keys in Game MainMenu, <br />\r\nPress once to unlock one level, and press twice to unlock all levels.",
    "about_the_game": "\uff081\uff09 Introduction to the game<br />\r\n&quot;Alien Maze&quot; is a puzzle game to explore the maze. Players need to reach the exit in a limited time.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\uff082\uff09 Game play<br />\r\nThe game operation uses the keyboard to operate the movement, and gets the acorn in the maze through the road.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOperation mode<br />\r\nW (upper) S (lower) A (left) D (right)<br />\r\nThe labyrinth road is winding. If you are not careful, you will go wrong. Use your brain and get out of the labyrinth.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game has a built-in one-button unlocking function.You need to press the 2 and 5 keys in Game MainMenu, <br />\r\nPress once to unlock one level, and press twice to unlock all levels.",
